    {
      "text": "It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "In rare cases, it molts and sheds its scales. Medicine containing its scales as an ingredient will make a weary body feel invigorated.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shiny objects are its passion. It can be found in its cave, scarcely moving, its gaze fixed on the jewels it’s amassed or Carbink it has caught.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves shiny things. When it finds a Sableye trying to catch a Carbink, Gabite becomes furiously angry and attacks the Sableye.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sheds its skin and gradually grows larger. Its scales can be ground into a powder and used as raw materials for traditional medicine.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon emits ultrasonic waves from a protrusion on either side of its head to probe pitch-dark caves.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jewels are buried in the caves these Pokémon nest in, but you’ll be torn apart by claws and fangs the moment you enter one of these caves.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though Gabite are usually of a violent disposition, when I gave one a glass bead it had been eyeing covetously, it suddenly became quite docile.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
